iming for a connection with his music. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - The success and reception of Calvin's album motivates him to make even better music (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Calvin's music is a source for sharing his experiences (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Calvin is adding electronic elements to his songs. (event_time: 2023-07-21T18:38:00Z)\n  - Concerts are a source of inspiration for Calvin. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Music has a way of touching Calvin's soul (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin keeps pushing his music. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - people: Calvin is currently on tour with Frank Ocean and finds juggling work and personal life overwhelming, though he pushes on. He is inspired by people's struggles to create deeper music.\n  - new sounds: Calvin is having fun trying out new sounds and pushing boundaries, always seeking new ideas to stay ahead.\n  - music program: Calvin is supporting young musicians from a music program, finding their passion and enthusiasm inspiring.\n  - favorite artists: Calvin and an artist discussed their favorite artists, art, and the power of music during an inspiring conversation at a Boston gala.\n  - ideas: Dave asked Calvin about trying new ideas at his music studio. Calvin is working with new talent and making a beat, which brings new ideas.\n  - music: Calvin and an artist discussed favorite artists, art, and music's power to connect people, leading to a creative high for Calvin. Dave also noted music fosters creativity.\n  - art: Calvin discussed art and music with a cool artist at a Boston gala, feeling creatively inspired. He is also making a beat for a young artist and pushing boundaries in his own art.\n  - Ratatouille: Calvin mentioned that Ratatouille is one of his favorites and that it's about pursuing what you love.\n  - power and happiness: Cal